{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02542","headline":"奉和入潼关 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和入潼关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曦驭循黄道，星陈引翠旗。\n济潼纡万乘，临河耀六师。\n前旌弥陆海，後骑发通伊。\n势踰回地轴，威盛转天机。\n是节岁穷纪，关树荡凉颸。\n仙露含灵掌，瑞鼎照川湄。\n冲襟赏临睨，高咏入京畿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}